 since."],"time":"2026-11-29 10:40","time1":"10:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":27,"move":"orbit","at":"jiuqu","alt":340,"dist":800,"from":240,"arc":40,"pitch":-14,"zh":["2024 年 0403 地震後，太魯閣段 28 處受災，","2026 年 3 月已修復 23 處，其餘預計 2028 年完成。"],"en":["After the earthquake of 3 April 2024, the Taroko section had 28 damaged sites;","by March 2026, 23 were repaired, and the rest are due in 2028."],"time":"2026-11-29 10:50","time1":"10:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.35,"base":1800,"kind":"mixed"},"grade":{"warm":0.15,"sat":1.04,"contrast":1.03}}},{"dur":25,"move":"push","at":"paifang","alt":50,"dist0":500,"dist":160,"from":110,"pitch":-8,"zh":["2026 年 2 月，被工程車撞損的牌樓","完成修復，恢復原貌。"],"en":["In February 2026 the archway, damaged by construction vehicles,","was restored to its original look."],"time":"2026-11-29 11:00","time1":"11:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":32,"move":"orbit","at":"gorge","alt":1200,"dist":5000,"from":140,"arc":30,"pitch":-14,"zh":["近七十年來，這條路一再被修築，","也一再被大自然考驗。","本片為電腦擬真重建：結構依公開資料簡化建模，","地形取自公開高程資料，不是實地空拍畫面。"],"en":["For nearly seventy years this road has been rebuilt again and again,","and tested again and again by nature.","A computer reconstruction: the structures are simplified models built from public data,","and the terrain comes from public elevation data. This is not real drone footage."],"time":"2026-11-29 11:10","time1":"11:15","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}}]},{"id":"works-impact","theme":"works-impact","title":{"zh-Hant":"中橫太魯閣段：功能與影響","en":"Central Cross-Island Highway: Use and Impact"},"tagline":{"zh-Hant":"東西的連結、觀光與地震之後","en":"Linking east and west, tourism, and life after the earthquake"},"time":"2026-11-29 13:30","weather":"clear","season":"autumn","shots":[{"dur":30,"move":"reveal","at":"gorge","weather":"few","alt":1100,"dist0":6000,"dist":3200,"from":80,"pitch":-14,"zh":["中橫通車後，台灣東西部之間多了一條穿越山脈的道路，","也打開了太魯閣峽谷的觀光。"],"en":["When it opened, the highway gave Taiwan a road across the mountains between east and west,","and opened Taroko Gorge to visitors."],"time":"2026-11-29 13:30","time1":"13:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"yanzikou","alt":300,"dist":700,"from":210,"arc":50,"pitch":-16,"zh":["1986 年太魯閣國家公園成立，","峽谷成為台灣最知名的景點之一。"],"en":["Taroko National Park was founded in 1986,","and the gorge became one of Taiwan's best-known sights."],"time":"2026-11-29 13:40","time1":"13:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"tianxiang","alt":500,"dist":1300,"from":120,"arc":40,"pitch":-12,"zh":["築路的退除役官兵，有不少留在沿線開墾，","梨山、福壽山一帶的農場就是這樣來的。"],"en":["Many of the veterans who built the road stayed on to farm along it;","that is how the farms around Lishan and Fushoushan began."],"time":"2026-11-29 13:50","time1":"13:54","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"buluowan","alt":320,"dist":800,"from":40,"arc":40,"pitch":-12,"zh":["這裡也是太魯閣族的傳統領域，","公路與國家公園改變了部落的生活。"],"en":["This is also traditional land of the Truku people,","and the road and the national park changed village life."],"time":"2026-11-29 14:00","time1":"14:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"jiuqu","alt":360,"dist":800,"from":250,"arc":-40,"pitch":-14,"zh":["0403 地震之後，部分步道與景點關閉，","觀光人潮大幅減少。"],"en":["After the April 2024 earthquake some trails and sights closed,","and visitor numbers fell sharply."],"time":"2026-11-29 14:10","time1":"14:14","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.35,"base":1800,"kind":"mixed"},"grade":{"warm":0.15,"sat":1.04,"contrast":1.03}}},{"dur":30,"move":"orbit","at":"zhuilu","alt":420,"dist":900,"from":140,"arc":40,"pitch":-12,"zh":["依 2026 年的公告，太魯閣口到天祥白天分時段放行、夜間封閉，","放行時段會隨施工進度調整。"],"en":["As announced in 2026, the road to Tianxiang opens in daytime windows and closes at night;","the windows change as the repair work progresses."],"time":"2026-11-29 14:20","time1":"14:24","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":30,"move":"pull","at":"gorge","alt":900,"dist0":2000,"dist":5000,"from":30,"pitch":-14,"zh":["出發前請查詢公路局的即時路況，","並遵守現場管制。"],"en":["Before setting out, check the Highway Bureau's live road conditions","and follow the controls on site."],"time":"2026-11-29 14:30","time1":"14:34","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.18,"base":2200,"kind":"cumulus"},"grade":{"warm":0.25,"sat":1.08,"contrast":1.05}}},{"dur":29,"move":"orbit","at":"changchun","alt":200,"dist":600,"from":170,"arc":40,"pitch":-10,"zh":["長春祠的重建預計約需 28 個月，","國家公園全面恢復開放，預估要到 2031 年。"],"en":["Rebuilding Changchun Shrine is expected to take about 28 months,","and the national park is not expected to reopen fully until 2031."],"time":"2026-11-29 14:40","time1":"14:44","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.15,"base":2400},"grade":{"warm":0.9,"sat":1.14,"contrast":1.07}}},{"dur":29,"move":"orbit","at":"paifang","alt":200,"dist":700,"from":140,"arc":50,"pitch":-10,"zh":["一條穿過峽谷的路，","連起東西兩岸，也連起一段難以忘記的歷史。"],"en":["A road through a gorge","that joins east and west, and keeps a history hard to forget."],"time":"2026-11-29 15:00","time1":"15:04","fx":{"shadow":true,"cloud":{"cover":0.15,"base":2400},"grade":{"warm":0.9,"sat":1.14,"contrast":1.07}}},{"dur":32,"move":"orbit","at":"gorge","alt":1300,"dist":5200,"from":200,"arc":30,"pitch":-14,"zh":["中部橫貫公路太魯閣段的四部影片到此結束。","歡迎到「AERO 無人機模擬飛行」親自飛一趟